      "insight": "Readers click securities headlines not for legal outcomes but for the compliance absurdity narrative — the paradox that even fully-licensed TradFi incumbents like Robinhood cannot achieve regulatory certainty, which signals the legal framework itself is the story, not the enforcement.",
